  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Fresh flowers left beside this sword are dry and brown by morning. Those who own one say the marrow worked into the blade is still alive, and that it draws on whatever grows nearby to stay that way.</p><p>You have a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. This magic weapon has 2 charges. When you hit with it, you can expend 1 charge: the target takes an extra [[/damage 4d8 type=necrotic]] damage. The weapon regains all expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
